	(descr "PLACEHOLDER. Amphenol Mini Cool Edge 0.60 mm 224-pos vertical SMT (ME1022410103011, board lock). Outer dims per Amphenol drawing CME102241010301X rev A: 85.56 overall, 83.76 body, keep-out 85.86 x 6.30. Pad rows/bay offsets approximate. fp3a: A1 at local -x with the A row at local -y (real layout); placed at 180 deg on the BP so A1 is at disc +x and the A row (host TX) faces the PSU side; host RX (B, core side) on L1, host TX via to L6.")
